  <description>
    <p>
      RBDOOM-3-BFG is based on DOOM-3-BFG and the goal of this port is to bring DOOM-3-BFG
      up to latest technology in 2021 making it closer to Doom 2016 while still remaining a
      DOOM 3 port regarding the gameplay.
    </p>
    <p>
      This version runs using X11 and OpenGL.
    </p>
  </description>
